the big mountains that others may face, and I hope it continues to stay this
way. If you were to ask me what my favourite moments I’ve had with you were,
I’d say all of them. But that’s not fair to say, so I’ll mention some. I loved
spending the week with you when your mum went to Perth. It really gave us a
small taste of what life could be like with each other in the future, and if I
be honest, I was and still am all for it. I also love your little phases of
craving specific foods, and it’s so cute to see your face light up when you get
it. Anyways, those were just little snippets of my favourite moments with you,
and I could go on and on about everything. Every moment with you is special and
I hope you know that. To be honest, I never knew that our relationship would
blossom into what it is today. I never expected for you to meet my family so
quick, and I definitely did not expect to go on a family trip 6 months in, and
to go on a trip with your family to Melbourne either. Back then, my mum
wouldn’t even let me go out late, so to let me go interstate and to be left in
the care of another family is definitely something quite big and significant,
and I think that’s what our relationship has become. It’s definitely something
I could see working out long term, and everyday I grow more and more sure
wanting you as mine forever. I love how you always cherish and support me no
matter what, and always celebrate the small goals that I achieve. Your love
goes a long way, and I’ve never felt so much love and support from anything
ever, and I will always treasure you, and your love towards me. I’ll always be
here as your cheerleader, and lover, and I’ll promise I’ll always lend you a
hand no matter what, when and where. I love our little side quests, and I’ll
always cherish those as well. I think we’ve really developed as a couple, and
it’s crazy to see how far we’ve come from day one with all our new experiences.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Anyways, It’s crazy to imagine that we’ve been together for
OVER a year now, and I wish there will be many more. I hope you know that I
love you very very much although I don’t express it as much as you do, and I’ll
give it my all to show you it more often in the near future. I can’t think of
anyone else I’d want to do life with other than you, and I promise you’ll
always be my number one. And the part we’ve all been waiting for. Happy one
year anniversary Katy Tran, I love you very much, and it’d be an understatement
if I said that this past year was the best year of my life.<o:p></o:p></p>

