<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>               
</span>longDesc: &quot;I remember Oktoberfest somewhat well, and I know that it
was on a Friday right after clinic. I remember mid-year, when it was brought up
I wasn’t gonna go, but as it got closer to the date, I decided to go because I
honestly liked you even more. I remember buying a Banh Mi, and was going to
give it to you at Clinic, but someone took the bus instead while I was at the
shopping centre like 3 minutes away haha. I then drove to the city, and that
honestly took way longer than expected because I got caught up in about 10
different traffic jams. I remember then finally meeting you at the uni, and
accompanying you to where you were working and sitting on the floor for god
knows how long haha. Buuut, before we did that, we did get to go on a nice
little walk and I enjoyed it very much. I remember midway through your shift, I
decided to go on a run because I was cold, and to maybe get rid of some of the
nerves. I also remember SOMEONE being a bad influence and giving me some of
their beer, and I also remember throwing grass at you because I was bored.
After you finished your shift, we immediately left that somewhat dead festival,
and went to chinatown! I remember getting those korean corndogs with you, where
it took like half an hour for it to come out. However, those thirty minutes
went by pretty fast with us both spilling our family tea/lore to each other,
and I think that was the first time that I really learnt a lot about you and
your family. This day was also the day I made you try my favourite big-back
spot called meet desserts where they had that 1L Boba, I actually never ended
up finishing that cup because I only got it as an excuse to spend sliiightly
more time with you.&quot;,<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                </span>quote:
