</span>longDesc: &quot;I remember asking you if you knew who I liked on the
train, and then you literally led me on to think that you thought that I liked
someone else. I was so worried on the train, and when I got home. Anyways,
let’s fast forward past that embarrassing time! I remember asking you what we
were because my friends were asking. Obviously, we knew who we both liked at
that point, and the feelings were mutual. Although I knew all this, I did not
expect for you to ask me out as I was in clinic, and it was honestly sooo
unexpected. I can’t lie, when I saw it, I had the biggest smile on my face, and
walking out of clinic, my eyes were glued to my phone to shoot you back a reply
as soon as I could. You really do know how to make me the happiest guy alive,
before and after us starting our relationship. &lt;3&quot;,<o:p></o:p></p>

